{"ok":false,"error":{"code":"SUBJECT_CONFLICT","reason":"APPROVED_BRIEF","message":"change `a` has an approved brief (.canon/changes/a/brief.md), so it is subject `s`'s approved scope and cannot be unadopted","retryable":false,"hint":"an approved change is the subject's approved scope and stays adopted; to take it out of the plan a human decides with `canon change defer a` or `canon change drop a` (a reason, a reference and the approver; an agent relays the human's answer with --relayed-via); unadopt only a change nobody approved"},"meta":{"command":"subject unadopt","schemaVersion":"1.0","tool":"canon","toolVersion":"0.44.0","contract":"atip/1","contractVersion":"1.6","context":{"repo":"."}}}
